  "releaseNotes": "- Added `GetUserAdminClubsAsync`, `GetUserFavoriteMapsAsync`, `AddUserFavoriteMapAsync`, and `RemoveUserFavoriteMapAsync` for player OAuth tokens\n- Added public JSON converters and access to `TrackmaniaAPIHandler.Authorization` for external serialization and player tokens\n- Fixed concurrent authorization for clients sharing a handler and encoding of multiple OAuth scopes\n- Fixed display name and account ID lookups handling empty results without hiding malformed JSON, and escaped display names in requests\n- Updated the User-Agent to report the installed package version\n- Added .NET 11 support",
